**🎯 Vehicle Status & Readiness Workflow (October 19, 2025):**

**Design Principle: Separate Vehicle Status from Vehicle Readiness**

**Vehicle Status (Operational State):**

```javascript
// Vehicle.status.currentStatus
enum: ["available", "assigned", "en_route", "on_scene", "returning"];
```

- `available` = At station, no active assignment
- `assigned` = Has assignment, not yet en route
- `en_route` = Traveling to incident
- `on_scene` = At incident location
- `returning` = Completed incident, returning to station (AVAILABLE for new assignments)

**Vehicle Readiness (Crew Leader Control):**

```javascript
// Vehicle.readiness (NEW FIELD)
{
  isReady: Boolean,        // Crew leader toggles this
  lastReadyUpdate: Date,
  notReadyReason: String
}
```

- Required for dispatcher to see vehicle in available vehicles list
- Independent of GPS tracking (automatic based on status)
- Defaults to FALSE on crew login (must actively mark ready)
- Automatically set to TRUE when "Returned to Station" clicked
- Crew can mark NOT READY for breaks, maintenance, fuel stops

**Complete Workflow:**

**1. Shift Start:**

```
Crew logs in → Vehicle status: "available", Readiness: FALSE
Crew sees: "⚠️ Vehicle Not Ready for Dispatch"
Crew clicks: "Mark Vehicle Ready"
Vehicle now: status="available", readiness.isReady=true
Dispatcher sees: Vehicle in available list with "At Station" badge
GPS: OFF (vehicle at station)
Location: Station coordinates (static)
```

**2. Assignment Created:**

```
Dispatcher assigns → Vehicle status: "assigned"
Readiness: Locked (cannot change during assignment)
GPS: Automatically STARTS tracking
Location: Updates from crew's phone every 15 seconds
```

**3. Crew Accepts → En Route:**

```
Crew taps "Accept" → status: "assigned"
Crew taps "Start En Route" → status: "en_route"
GPS: Continues tracking
Location: Real-time updates
```

**4. On Scene:**

```
Crew taps "Arrived On Scene" → status: "on_scene"
GPS: Continues tracking
Location: Real-time updates
```

**5. Complete Assignment:**

```
Crew taps "Complete Assignment" →
  Assignment status: "completed" (final state)
  Vehicle status: "returning"
  Readiness: TRUE (locked, still in assignment lifecycle)
GPS: Continues tracking during return journey
Location: Updates as crew drives back
Dispatcher sees: Vehicle in "Available Vehicles" with "Returning to Station" badge (blue)
Vehicle: SELECTABLE for new assignments immediately
```

**6. Returned to Station:**

```
Crew taps "Returned to Station" →
  Vehicle status: "available"
  Vehicle location: Reset to station coordinates
  Readiness: Automatically TRUE
GPS: STOPS (back at station)
Dispatcher sees: Vehicle with "At Station" badge (green)
```

**GPS Tracking Rules (AUTOMATIC - No Manual Control):**

| Vehicle Status | GPS Tracking    | Location Source     | Dispatcher Display                    |
| -------------- | --------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| available      | OFF             | Station coordinates | Static marker at station              |
| assigned       | ON (auto-start) | Crew phone GPS      | Live updating marker + green GPS icon |
| en_route       | ON              | Crew phone GPS      | Live updating marker + green GPS icon |
| on_scene       | ON              | Crew phone GPS      | Live updating marker + green GPS icon |
| returning      | ON (continues!) | Crew phone GPS      | Live updating marker + green GPS icon |

**When "Returned to Station" clicked:** GPS stops, location reset to station, status → available

**Key Implementation Details:**

**Backend - Crew Location Update Syncs to Vehicle:**

```javascript
// crewController.js - updateCrewLocationLegacy()
// After updating crew location:
if (crew.currentStatus.assignedVehicleId) {
  // Sync vehicle location with crew location
  await Vehicle.findByIdAndUpdate(vehicleId, {
    "status.currentLocation": { type: "Point", coordinates: [lng, lat] },
    "status.lastLocationUpdate": new Date(),
  });

  // Emit vehicle location update for dispatcher map
  io.emit("vehicle_location_update", {
    vehicleId,
    location: { type: "Point", coordinates: [lng, lat] },
    timestamp: new Date().toISOString(),
  });
}
```

**Mobile - Automatic GPS Management:**

```javascript
// locationService.ts - Automatic based on vehicle status
useEffect(() => {
  const vehicleStatus = vehicle?.status?.currentStatus;

  if (
    ["assigned", "en_route", "on_scene", "returning"].includes(vehicleStatus)
  ) {
    // Start tracking if not already
    if (!locationService.isCurrentlyTracking()) {
      locationService.startTracking(crew._id);
    }
  } else {
    // Stop tracking when back to available
    if (locationService.isCurrentlyTracking()) {
      locationService.stopTracking();
    }
  }
}, [vehicle?.status?.currentStatus]);
```

